schedule=coarse (repeat fills and drains per run of quads, stride-0 repeated weight runs, one weight task per column for single-round groups, chunk repeats and contiguous-dimension folding, per-quad upsample fills), 20x20 groups balanced over the four columns, input blocks trimmed in packet headers; kernel computes a row's fifth pixel group once (kernels/aie2/conv_engine/engine.cc)
