model=models/yolov8n_cut_xint8.onnx; every layer of this schedule is byte-exact on Device 0 (tests/test_engine_graph.py --hardware --per-layer and single dispatch) and in packet emulation (--offline); the direct integer reference equals ONNX Runtime's uint8 intermediates
